From 73737cbdf6fd3a74b8798c4b46e436cddf258bdb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Rodrigo M. Duarte" <rodrigo.duarte@ossystems.com.br>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 14:41:05 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] mlinux: moal_sta_cfg80211: fix probe_client build on 7.2
 kernels

The driver assumes the probe_client cfg80211 op was renamed to
probe_peer in Linux 7.2, but the rename landed in v7.3-rc1; v7.2
still has probe_client. Building against a mainline-based 7.2 kernel
fails with:

  moal_sta_cfg80211.c: error: 'struct cfg80211_ops' has no member
  named 'probe_peer'

Move the version check to 7.3.0, so 7.2 kernels use probe_client.
Older kernels are not affected.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Rodrigo M. Duarte <rodrigo.duarte@ossystems.com.br>
---
 mlinux/moal_sta_cfg80211.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/mlinux/moal_sta_cfg80211.c b/mlinux/moal_sta_cfg80211.c
index 2605630..e246aeb 100644
--- a/mlinux/moal_sta_cfg80211.c
+++ b/mlinux/moal_sta_cfg80211.c
@@ -12247,7 +12247,7 @@ mlan_status woal_register_cfg80211(moal_private *priv)
 		woal_cfg80211_ops.disconnect = NULL;
 		woal_cfg80211_ops.connect = NULL;
 #ifdef UAP_SUPPORT
-#if CFG80211_VERSION_CODE >= KERNEL_VERSION(7, 2, 0)
+#if CFG80211_VERSION_CODE >= KERNEL_VERSION(7, 3, 0)
 		woal_cfg80211_ops.probe_peer = woal_cfg80211_probe_client;
 #else
 		woal_cfg80211_ops.probe_client = woal_cfg80211_probe_client;
-- 
2.54.0

